  "project_description": "Adds a monitoring service to all entity forms to check if the entity on the form has been updated or deleted since the form has been loaded. If the entity has been changed or deleted, then it either reloads the page if nothing has been changed on the form, or prompts the user with a dialog to reload the page. Works for all entities embedded with the Inline Entity Form module . This helps give users a heads up that their form submission is out of date before they even submit the form.\n\n Related modules \n \n Conflict : Use this if you want to handle data in a more elegant fashion, attempting to merge the changes instead of forcing the user to reload the page. \n Autosave",
